sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design from ADR 0244: native Swamp schedules, nothing installed on the Node.
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Target Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: schedule:enable<br/>{schedule: 7f3c…}
  Note over GW: Mark the Schedule enabled<br/>calendar, command, budget
  GW->>SW: Publish the trigger<br/>workflow.trigger.set
  SW-->>GW: trigger active
  GW-->>CLI: Schedule enabled<br/>next fire 03:00
  loop each calendar fire
    Note over SW: serve fires a root run<br/>task-command-run
    SW->>N: Run the command<br/>@swamp/ssh, as the Schedule's user
    N-->>SW: exit code, output
    GW->>SW: Read new runs<br/>shared run reader
    SW-->>GW: run started / finished
    Note over GW: Record the task<br/>trigger: schedule
  end
